                                                "sense_id": "9b19c3b5-0008-391d-840a-695bfcf9e92d",
                                                "text": "If we had been allowed to sit idle we should all have fallen in the blues […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d297bd7c-6e0e-3efe-af95-cc659a8f12eb",
                                        "entry_id": "153f993d-e332-3e9d-9963-c9c6f65d510c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feeling of sadness or depression.",
                                            "One's particular life experience, particularly including the hardships one has faced."
                                        ],
