                                        "entry_id": "153f993d-e332-3e9d-9963-c9c6f65d510c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A musical form, African-American in origin, generally featuring an eight-bar or twelve-bar blues structure and using the blues scale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
